menu "PlantHub Wrappers"

config PLANTHUB_WRAPPER_ARENA
    int "Wrapper bytecode arena size (bytes)"
    default 4096 if IDF_TARGET_ESP32C5
    default 2048
    help
        Size of the shared LRU-evicted arena holding LOADED wrapper
        bytecode blobs (M3 spec section 2), packed by their actual size
        rather than a fixed slot each -- this is what makes the 16-wrapper,
        2 KB-bytecode-each store affordable on the C3: the store itself is
        a flash limit (16 * 2 KB, LittleFS), the arena is the RAM cost, and
        the two are deliberately not the same number. A realistic wrapper
        compiles to a few hundred bytes, so this default holds several of
        them resident at once; only a pathological near-2 KB wrapper fills
        it alone.

endmenu
